	'k0802e663' => 'Adaeze Nwosu',
	'k0a818ee6' => 'Henrik Aas handles owner relations. He is the person to ask for when the call is about listing, rather than about taking a bay. Call 555-0142 or write to viewings@hashirapartners.example, and name him. The office is Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. Office hours are Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. We reply within 1 business day. Tell him the building, the bay if it already has a number, the size in m² and the clear height you understand the space to have.',
