	'k16e01941' => 'Pages and notes that match your words.',
	'k1790371d' => 'The middle band is 160 to 280 m². Bay 3 at Tanner Row Sheds is 180 m², parts storage, one level floor and a roller door wide enough for two vans. The building runs 90 to 180 m² with a clear height of 6 m and rent from $12 per m² per month. Bay 7 at Mill Cross Yard is 240 m², cool dispatch, in a building of 10 bays from 150 to 300 m², clear height 6.5 m, rent from $11. Quay Lane Units runs 120 to 240 m² with a clear height of 5.5 m and rent from $14, so its larger bays fall here. Ferry Road Depot reaches 220 m². Use this band when the work needs more than a single bench and does not need a hall. Tell Priya Raman the size on the 20-minute call and she will keep the short list to 3 bays.',
