	'k1b40de66' => 'We reply within 1 business day. The lease, if there is one, is between the firm taking the bay and the owner. Lucía Ferrer reads the heads of terms through with you when a bay fits. She does that as our lease clerk. The firm does not become the landlord by arranging the visit. Districts we work in are Eastgate, Riverside and Mill Cross.',
	'k1bd3cdca' => 'Notes from the bays',
	'k1c869046' => 'A print finisher needed 8 m clear and a floor rated for its folder, which Daniel Cho checked before terms.',
	'k1d3f1761' => 'Tanner Row Sheds is in Eastgate. It has 12 bays, from 90 to 180 m², with a clear height of 6 m. Rent starts at $12 per m² per month. The building is a low row of corrugated sheds with roller shutters. Tomasz Wrona, agent for Eastgate and Mill Cross, shows it. Bay 3, at 180 m², is the stockroom in our parts-storage note: one level floor and a roller door wide enough for two vans.',
	'k1ebbe1d1' => 'The office is Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. What you sent should already include the useful facts: your name, your email, the size you need and the district. If you were writing as an owner, Henrik Aas is the person who handles listings. If you joined the new bay list, the next thing you receive is the monthly note, not a same-day tour of all 50 bays.',
	'k1f833068' => 'Why we write them',
	'k205e029a' => 'All case notes →',
	'k209520e6' => 'In 2014 Mika Hashira founded Hashira Partners in Port Merrin. She is founder and managing partner. The firm leases small warehouse bays to local firms and shows them in the bay. The office is still Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row. The portfolio is still 6 buildings and 50 bays, from 90 to 420 m², in Eastgate, Riverside and Mill Cross. A viewing raises the shutter, walks the floor and includes the owner where that can be arranged.',
	'k20a7cc0b' => 'A clear height of 5.5 m suits stock and light bench work. A use that needs 8 m of clear height belongs at Foundry Court, which Priya Raman will say on the 20-minute call. If Riverside and this size are what you asked for, Quay Lane Units can sit in the first round of up to 3 bays.',
	'k20b4f77b' => 'Cost',
	'k20c8b739' => 'How to join',
	'k224e94ed' => 'Priya Raman uses the first reply, within 1 business day, to say so. Office hours for arranging the call are Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Viewing hours are Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. The aim of that first conversation is three bays that exist, not a morning spent on buildings we do not lease.',
