	'k2a944711' => 'Daniel Cho, building surveyor, checks a floor before terms when the use needs it, as he did for the folder at Bay 2, Foundry Court.',
	'k2c2c2e92' => 'First viewing round, up to 3 bays: Free. Each extra viewing round: $120. Floor and loading check report: $340. Lease read-through with our clerk: $480. Placement fee, lease up to 24 months: 1 month\'s rent. Placement fee, lease of 25 months or more: 1.5 months\' rent. Amounts are in USD. Areas on this site are in m², with no conversion. Lucía Ferrer is the clerk named in the read-through.',
	'k2d4dd25f' => 'If you request a viewing, the form asks for your name, your email, the size you need and the district. If you call 555-0142, we take those same facts in the conversation. If you join the new bay list, we ask for a single email address. If you write to viewings@hashirapartners.example, we keep what you put in the message: the size, the district and when you need the bay, or, for an owner, that you want to list.',
	'k2ed92220' => 'We viewed Bay 7 at Mill Cross Yard at 05:00 because a flower wholesaler needed that loading slot. The published window for ordinary rounds remains Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free. Each extra viewing round is $120. Call 555-0142 in office hours if the timing is the part you need to settle.',
	'k2fdf7c2a' => 'The new bay list is a monthly note of bays that have come free. It covers only the 6 buildings we lease: Tanner Row Sheds, Quay Lane Units, Mill Cross Yard, Foundry Court, Ferry Road Depot and Orchard Street Works. Sizes stay inside 90 to 420 m². The note names the building, the district and the size, and it uses that building\'s published starting rent in USD per m² per month. It is an early look at bays we would otherwise offer when you request a viewing.',
	'k302e11f0' => 'What the reply is for',
	'k310830ff' => 'The largest band is 280 to 420 m². Foundry Court carries it: 6 bays, 200 to 420 m², clear height 8 m, rent from $11 per m² per month, in Eastgate, in a tall foundry hall. Mill Cross Yard reaches 300 m², so its largest bays cross into this band, with a clear height of 6.5 m and rent from $11. Bay 2 at Foundry Court is 320 m². A print finisher needed 8 m clear and a floor rated for its folder, which Daniel Cho checked before terms. The band stops at 420 m². We do not handle a larger bay. One big machine, or a finisher that cannot sit under a lower roof, belongs in this conversation, and Foundry Court is the first building we will name. The first viewing round can still include it among 3 bays, at no charge.',
	'k315b0ec0' => 'The placement fee is paid only once a lease is signed. It is not due at the request, on the 20-minute call, or at the end of a viewing round. Placement fee, lease up to 24 months: 1 month\'s rent. Placement fee, lease of 25 months or more: 1.5 months\' rent. One row applies, not both. The rent is the rent agreed on that lease. Published starting rents are $12 per m² per month at Tanner Row Sheds, $14 at Quay Lane Units, $11 at Mill Cross Yard, $11 at Foundry Court, $13 at Ferry Road Depot and $15 at Orchard Street Works.',
	'k32fa9c9f' => 'A flower wholesaler wanted north light and a 05:00 loading slot, so we viewed the yard at that hour.',
	'k335fdb83' => 'Riverside',
	'k340dfcf8' => 'Fees,',
	'k342de95e' => 'We do not ask for a payment card on this site. The six published fees are agreed around the viewing and the lease. They are not taken through the form. The office that receives this is Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. Send only what the request needs. A size in m² and a district, Eastgate, Riverside or Mill Cross, are enough to start a reply.',
	'k34cbfe62' => 'A colleague can come if they also need to see the floor. Priya Raman uses the 20-minute call to cut the list to 3 bays. The agent uses the visit to measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power. A change in size or district is more useful in the request than at the shutter. Write to viewings@hashirapartners.example or call 555-0142.',
	'k35609117' => '6 bays of 200–420 m², clear height 8 m. Rent from $11 per m² per month.',
	'k356e679c' => 'Office hours are Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Viewing hours are Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. A viewing round takes about 2 hours and is booked inside those viewing hours. The 20-minute call with Priya Raman is arranged in office hours. We reply to a request within 1 business day, meaning a weekday inside Mon–Fri. A note sent on Saturday waits for the next office day, even though viewings run on Saturday morning. If you need a bay seen at the hour you load, say so in the request.',
	'k3601146c' => 'Price',
	'k362008ae' => 'At the bay we measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power. A separate floor and loading check report, prepared by Daniel Cho, is there if you need it.',
	'k370964ee' => 'With',
	'k3801a7b8' => 'We note the neighbour and the yard when they are part of the ask, as with dust and the shared yard at Bay 6, Ferry Road Depot. The owner, when present, answers for the building. We record what we saw on the day: the opening, the route, the power, the height and the floor. We do not turn the visit into a score. The first round covers up to 3 bays and takes about 2 hours.',
	'k38288b44' => 'Placement fee, lease up to 24 months: 1 month\'s rent. Placement fee, lease of 25 months or more: 1.5 months\' rent. The placement fee is paid only once a lease is signed. A request, a call and a viewing round do not reserve the bay. If none of the three bays fits, the process stops at the viewing. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, stays free.',
	'k386d0822' => 'A bicycle-parts seller outgrew a garage and needed one level floor with a roller door wide enough for two vans. Tanner Row Sheds is in Eastgate. The building has 12 bays, from 90 to 180 m², a clear height of 6 m, and rent from $12 per m² per month. Bay 3 sits at the top of that size range.',
	'k38ee1533' => 'Tell us the size, the district and when you need the bay. Eastgate, Riverside and Mill Cross are the three districts on our list. We reply within 1 business day.',
	'k3adec88d' => 'The people who see a given request are the people the work needs: Mika Hashira as managing partner, the agents Tomasz Wrona and Adaeze Nwosu, Lucía Ferrer, Daniel Cho, Priya Raman and Henrik Aas. Office hours for this handling are Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Viewing hours, if a round is booked, are Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. We keep the details for that work of showing and letting bays.',
