	'k446349ed' => 'Thank you. We have the request, and we will reply within 1 business day. The reply comes to the email you gave, from viewings@hashirapartners.example. If you would rather speak, the office number is 555-0142. Office hours are Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. A business day is one of those weekdays. A request sent on Saturday waits for the next office day, even though viewing hours run Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. You do not need to send the same note again in the meantime.',
