	'k5b10783e' => 'A 20-minute call with Priya Raman to narrow the list to 3 bays. She uses the size, the district and the date you already sent, then the limits that decide a short list: clear height, the shutter, the loading route and whether the owner can be in the room. Eastgate is Tanner Row Sheds and Foundry Court. Riverside is Quay Lane Units and Ferry Road Depot. Mill Cross is Mill Cross Yard and Orchard Street Works.',
