	'k5e4b33b5' => 'Daniel Cho is our building surveyor. The note says he checked the floor. It does not publish a pass mark or a score for a different machine. On the viewing itself we still measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power. A written floor and loading check report, if you want one for your own equipment, is $340.',
	'k5f067980' => 'A listing puts your bay in front of local firms who ask us for space. We show it inside a viewing round of about 2 hours, up to 3 bays, with an agent and, where possible, with you in the room. The round is booked on viewing hours, Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. We publish the building, the district, the size, the clear height and the starting rent, and those figures stay the same everywhere we state them.',
