	'k6468afec' => 'Quay Lane · 120–240 m²',
	'k65aef13c' => 'Hashira Partners is a small-warehouse leasing broker, founded in 2014. The office is Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. Mika Hashira is founder and managing partner. We find bays for local firms and we show them. We also take listings from owners, and listing a bay is free. A viewing is a visit to a bay, arranged by us, with an agent and, where possible, the owner. Contact for that work is viewings@hashirapartners.example and 555-0142.',
	'k65c5943f' => 'We write case notes so a firm can see a real ask next to a real bay before requesting a viewing. Each note has a project, a concept, a short overview and a type of work. The four published notes are parts storage, cool dispatch, print finishing and a workshop.',
	'k66818949' => 'The placement fee is paid only once a lease is signed: 1 month\'s rent for a lease up to 24 months, 1.5 months\' rent for 25 months or more. Nothing is due when you send a request, take the call or finish a viewing round. The lease is between the firm and the owner; we are the broker.',
	'k6791239b' => 'A note does not carry a move-in date, a saving or a rating. Tenants are described by the work they do, not by a personal name we put on the page. The reader gets the ask and the bay: the shutter, the floor, the light, the height, the yard. The reader does not get word that the same bay is free, or that the next firm will see the same fit. If you want to see a building rather than read about it, request a viewing.',
