	'k6a7e7316' => 'Hours',
	'k6ac326f7' => 'Hashira Partners is at Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. Write to viewings@hashirapartners.example or call 555-0142. We reply within 1 business day. The office is open Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Ask for Priya Raman if you are requesting a viewing. Ask for Lucía Ferrer if you want the heads of terms read through. Ask for Daniel Cho if you need a floor and loading check. Ask for Henrik Aas if you own a bay and want to list it.',
