	'k6f69fe82' => 'Send a request',
	'k6f6bf79a' => 'Foundry Court is in Eastgate. It has 6 bays, from 200 to 420 m², with a clear height of 8 m. Rent starts at $11 per m² per month. The building is a tall foundry hall with steel windows, and these are the largest bays we lease. Tomasz Wrona shows them with Tanner Row Sheds. Bay 2, at 320 m², is the print-finishing note. A print finisher needed 8 m clear and a floor rated for its folder, which Daniel Cho checked before terms.',
