	'k76727c54' => 'Viewings and fees',
	'k76a79bbe' => 'we\'ll reply soon.',
	'k77442ae3' => 'Listing a bay is free for owners. Call 555-0142 and ask for Henrik Aas, or write to viewings@hashirapartners.example; we reply within 1 business day. We take bays from 90 to 420 m², but not cold stores or hazardous storage. The placement fee applies only if a lease is later signed.',
	'k77c27ccd' => 'We showed the shutter raised and walked the floor, and the width of the door was judged against two vans because that was the working question. The note stops at the ask and the bay. There is no move-in date, no saving and no score. Tomasz Wrona covers Eastgate if you want to know whether a similar bay is free. Tell us the size, the district and when you need it.',
	'k77fe73ee' => 'If you need a written floor and loading check before terms, ask for the report at $340. If you need the heads of terms read, ask Lucía Ferrer. If you are listing, ask Henrik Aas. Agents on the day are Tomasz Wrona for Eastgate and Mill Cross, and Adaeze Nwosu for Riverside and Ferry Road. We reply within 1 business day from Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin.',
	'k78413552' => 'What we do',
	'k79870df4' => 'Clear height is the height we publish for the building, the open distance under the roof. The six figures are 6 m at Tanner Row Sheds, 5.5 m at Quay Lane Units, 6.5 m at Mill Cross Yard, 8 m at Foundry Court, 5 m at Ferry Road Depot and 4.5 m at Orchard Street Works. If the machine, the racking or the stacked goods need more than that figure, the building is the wrong one. Shutter width is the opening we measure on the day, at that bay.',
	'k799b373c' => '1.5 months\' rent',
	'k79e66e91' => 'results.',
	'k7ad6e8e5' => 'You may write and ask what we hold under your name or email, ask us to correct it, or ask us to drop an address from the new bay list. Use viewings@hashirapartners.example or call 555-0142 in office hours, Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. We reply within 1 business day. Name the email address you used, and say whether the note is about a viewing request, an owner listing or the monthly list. For the list, we take the address off the next month\'s note when you ask.',
	'k7c1ed646' => 'If one bay fits, Lucía Ferrer, our lease clerk, reads the heads of terms through with you. The placement fee is due only once a lease is signed, not at the viewing.',
	'k7cad581d' => 'Daniel Cho',
	'k7cdc93ea' => 'Owners',
	'k7d74f3b9' => 'Item',
	'k80578cbc' => 'Join the list',
	'k814ee6f3' => 'Longer notes on a bay, a use and the check we made. Sizes, rents and heights match the buildings page.',
	'k819ca101' => 'Bay 7, Mill Cross Yard',
	'k832408a2' => 'A furniture restorer wanted a bench by the shutter and a neighbour who would not mind dust. Ferry Road Depot is in Riverside. It has 9 bays, from 100 to 220 m², a clear height of 5 m, and rent from $13 per m² per month.',
	'k835c4d1a' => 'We reply within 1 business day. If you want to leave the list, write to the same address and say so. We take that address off the next month\'s note. The office is Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin, and the phone is 555-0142, Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Send one address. The monthly note is the whole of what that address receives from the list.',
	'k83a035c6' => 'When is the placement fee due?',
	'k83fdfdea' => 'No notes yet.',
	'k86490fcb' => 'Three size bands from 90 to 420 m², and what a shutter width and a clear height mean for your work.',
	'k86bc0721' => 'First viewing round, up to 3 bays',
	'k872dfd86' => 'Notes from',
	'k87f78cef' => 'Priya Raman, viewing coordinator, runs the 20-minute call that narrows a list to 3 bays.',
	'k88339c45' => 'Bay 7, Mill Cross Yard, 240 m²',
	'k89096013' => 'Foundry Court',
	'k8a63b6a2' => 'Come to',
	'k8b34364f' => 'We show your bay in a round of about 2 hours, up to 3 bays, with you in the room where possible.',
	'k8b4908d8' => 'Founded in 2014',
	'k8cf018be' => 'Foundry Court · 200–420 m²',
	'k8cff2544' => 'Orchard Street Works is in Mill Cross. It has 5 bays, from 90 to 160 m², with a clear height of 4.5 m. Rent starts at $15 per m² per month. The street is a narrow run of small workshops with roller doors. Tomasz Wrona shows it with Mill Cross Yard. The clear height and the bay sizes suit a bench, light storage or a small making room. A tall machine belongs at Foundry Court, where the clear height is 8 m, and a larger stockroom pattern belongs at Tanner Row Sheds or Mill Cross Yard.',
	'k8d080b33' => 'An empty bay is a beginning. See it with the shutter raised and the owner in the room.',
	'k8d3f8d48' => 'Buildings<br>we handle',
	'k8da413d5' => 'Measure the shutter, walk the loading route, test the power. The measurement is the opening at the bay you are in, taken because a guess from the pavement is useless. The walk follows the way a van would approach that opening, including the canopy at Ferry Road Depot where the loading edge is covered. The power test is a test of that unit on that day. Clear height is read against the building: 6 m at Tanner Row Sheds, 5.5 m at Quay Lane Units, 6.5 m at Mill Cross Yard, 8 m at Foundry Court, 5 m at Ferry Road Depot and 4.5 m at Orchard Street Works.',
	'k8e5d9dbc' => 'Workshop',
	'k8e770753' => 'fifty bays.',
	'k8f869dcd' => 'A firm looking for a small warehouse is often handed a size and a rent and left to picture the rest. We would rather raise the shutter. Hashira Partners was founded in 2014 to broker bays of 90–420 m² in Port Merrin: six buildings, 50 bays, in Eastgate, Riverside and Mill Cross. Priya Raman narrows the list to three. An agent walks them, with the owner where that can be arranged. The first viewing round is free.',
	'k9022d848' => 'Mika Hashira, founder, managing partner, still asks that a viewing raise the shutter, walk the floor and include the owner where possible.',
	'k91426b97' => 'Five steps from request to terms. The first round is free: about 2 hours, up to 3 bays.',
	'k92670d18' => 'The new bay list',
	'k9272910f' => 'Building surveyor',
	'k93060f33' => 'Yes. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free. It takes about 2 hours. An agent attends, and the owner attends where possible. Each extra viewing round is $120. The 20-minute call with Priya Raman sets the three bays. We reply to the request within 1 business day. Office hours are Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Viewing hours are Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. The floor and loading check report at $340, and the lease read-through with our clerk at $480, are not folded into the free round.',
	'k93ce04dd' => 'We find small warehouse bays for local firms, and we show them properly: the shutter raised, the floor walked, the owner in the room.',
	'k9406efac' => 'Bay guide,',
	'k94d986e1' => '10 bays of 150–300 m², clear height 6.5 m. Rent from $11 per m² per month.',
	'k94f8f217' => 'A note is not an offer of the same bay next week. Availability sits with the viewing desk. Write to viewings@hashirapartners.example or call 555-0142. We reply within 1 business day, and Priya Raman narrows a live list to 3 bays on a 20-minute call.',
	'k9571c686' => 'Riverside means Quay Lane Units and Ferry Road Depot, with Adaeze Nwosu. Mill Cross means Mill Cross Yard and Orchard Street Works, also with Tomasz Wrona. Call 555-0142 before you set out if you need the building named again. Write to viewings@hashirapartners.example with the size, the district and when you need the bay. We reply within 1 business day from this office.',
	'k961110ad' => 'Priya Raman, the viewing coordinator, spends 20 minutes on a call. She uses that conversation to narrow the list to 3 bays that match the size and the district you named.',
	'k96147397' => 'Lease read-through with our clerk',
	'k9616e688' => 'We show Orchard Street Works the same way as the other five: shutter raised, floor walked, owner in the room where possible. If you want the smaller Mill Cross bays, write 90 to 160 m² and Mill Cross on the request. We reply within 1 business day.',
	'k967ac923' => 'The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free. It takes about 2 hours, with an agent and, where possible, the owner. We reply to a request within 1 business day, and viewings run Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. Nothing is signed by walking through a door.',
	'k987b3c77' => 'Directions',
	'k9882e11a' => 'Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row<br>Port Merrin',
	'k99092368' => 'We handle 6 buildings and 50 bays, from 90 to 420 m². We do not handle bays over 420 m², cold stores or hazardous storage. A case note describes one ask and one bay. It is not a statement that the same bay is free, that a floor will suit a machine Daniel Cho has not checked, or that a neighbour will accept every use. A request, a call and a viewing do not reserve a bay. Any letting is the lease signed with the owner.',
	'k9b196963' => 'Ask for them if you want them. If a lease is signed later, the placement fee is a different line. Placement fee, lease up to 24 months: 1 month\'s rent. Placement fee, lease of 25 months or more: 1.5 months\' rent. It is paid only once a lease is signed. Walking the first three bays does not create that fee.',
	'k9b6e83a0' => 'The brokerage',
	'k9e45107e' => 'shown properly.',
	'k9e598e3b' => 'Early mornings, cold floors',
	'k9e727fdd' => 'Project',
	'k9fdd5aad' => 'Buildings',
	'ka1fa2777' => 'Type',
	'ka1fec1a8' => 'Placement fee, lease up to 24 months',
	'ka2dde97d' => 'Listing a bay is free for owners. There is no listing price beside the six fees we publish for the letting process. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free to the firm that comes to look. Each extra viewing round is $120. A floor and loading check report is $340. A lease read-through with our clerk is $480. The placement fee is paid only once a lease is signed. Placement fee, lease up to 24 months: 1 month\'s rent.',
	'ka31947a9' => 'The first band is 90 to 160 m². Orchard Street Works sits inside it: 5 bays, 90 to 160 m², clear height 4.5 m, rent from $15 per m² per month, in Mill Cross, on a narrow street of small workshops. Smaller bays at Tanner Row Sheds start at 90 m² with a clear height of 6 m and rent from $12. Ferry Road Depot starts at 100 m² with a clear height of 5 m and rent from $13. Bay 6 at Ferry Road Depot is 160 m², a workshop with a bench by the shutter and a shared yard. This band suits a bench, light storage or stock that used to live in a smaller room, with a roller door you can work beside. A tall machine is the wrong ask here. Name 90 to 160 m², and the district, when you request a viewing.',
	'ka347ac04' => 'Orchard Street Works',
	'ka56d3251' => 'Agent, Eastgate and Mill Cross',
	'ka654be09' => 'All buildings →',
	'ka6698425' => 'Notes is the journal of Hashira Partners. A note records a bay and a use in plain words: the project, the concept, a short overview and the type of work. The four case notes set the pattern. Bay 3 at Tanner Row Sheds, 180 m², is parts storage. Bay 7 at Mill Cross Yard, 240 m², is cool dispatch. Bay 2 at Foundry Court, 320 m², is print finishing. Bay 6 at Ferry Road Depot, 160 m², is a workshop. A longer note can take one of those visits and tell the hour and the check properly, as with the 05:00 viewing at Mill Cross Yard.',
	'ka7a750a6' => 'Case notes',
	'ka810b393' => 'Three bays is the shape of the free first viewing round. If you already know you need the 8 m clear height at Foundry Court, the call can spend its time on which of those 6 bays are worth the walk, and on whether any second building belongs in the three. Tomasz Wrona covers Eastgate and Mill Cross. Adaeze Nwosu covers Riverside and Ferry Road.',
	'kaaeed9bf' => 'in six rows.',
	'kac848fa2' => 'Team',
	'kac889813' => 'Mill Cross · 90–160 m² · 4.5 m clear · from $15',
	'kae30c261' => 'Founded in 2014 in Port Merrin: agents, a lease clerk, a surveyor and a viewing coordinator.',
	'kaf69ec86' => 'Send your name, your email, the size you need and the district: Eastgate, Riverside or Mill Cross. Priya Raman replies within 1 business day. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free.',
	'kb0da1ce3' => 'Lease clerk',
	'kb0e07635' => 'Bay 6, Ferry Road Depot, 160 m²',
	'kb202df54' => 'We raise the shutter and walk the floor before anyone discusses terms. If you need Eastgate and a bay in this size range, name Tanner Row Sheds when you request a viewing. We reply within 1 business day. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free, and this building can be one of the three.',
	'kb24ce0cd' => 'Free',
	'kb347ed32' => 'runs.',
	'kb3be0ffb' => 'Our view',
	'kb659b9ef' => 'A stockroom with a van door',
	'kb6ab8667' => 'An agent and, where possible, the owner',
	'kb7a89791' => 'Mill Cross · 150–300 m² · 6.5 m clear · from $11',
	'kb7e797e0' => 'Stock, vans and mixed work',
	'kb98ac839' => 'Eastgate · 200–420 m² · 8 m clear · from $11',
	'kba2a9c6c' => 'Length',
	'kbaabba28' => 'viewings@hashirapartners.example',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbbdbe556' => '8 bays of 120–240 m², clear height 5.5 m. Rent from $14 per m² per month.',
	'kbccb5d35' => 'Page not',
	'kbfd56f3c' => 'Error 404',
	'kc17ddf52' => 'Bay 2, Foundry Court, 320 m²',
	'kc2461944' => 'If one bay fits, Lucía Ferrer reads the heads of terms through with you. She is our lease clerk, and the read-through is $480. It is time with the heads themselves, so a line can be asked about before anyone treats a lease as agreed. Hashira Partners is the broker. The lease is between the firm taking the bay and the owner. The placement fee is separate from the read-through.',
	'kc2e55bc9' => 'We do not publish one width for a whole building. At Bay 3, Tanner Row Sheds, the question was whether the roller door was wide enough for two vans. On every viewing we measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power. Bring what must pass the door, described in the request, and Daniel Cho can check the floor when the weight of a machine is the real question. The written report of that check is $340.',
	'kc3755e61' => 'Call',
	'kc517dcf8' => 'What you send us',
	'kc5b3f145' => 'Bay 2, Foundry Court',
	'kc5f29bb3' => 'Privacy',
	'kc61b336d' => 'What we check',
	'kc6da0c64' => 'Listing is free. If you asked for the new bay list, you are on the monthly note of newly free bays. Nothing is booked until we confirm it in the reply. A request does not reserve a bay. Keep the inbox you named where you will see it. For the heads of terms later, the clerk is Lucía Ferrer. For a floor check, the surveyor is Daniel Cho. We answer from the same office either way.',
	'kc6f5c563' => 'Adaeze Nwosu, agent, Riverside and Ferry Road, shows Quay Lane Units and Ferry Road Depot.',
	'kc7114a5c' => 'Tomasz Wrona',
	'kc71b3327' => 'Request a viewing',
	'kc73795dd' => 'Each extra viewing round',
	'kc7d98794' => '280–420 m²',
	'kc8731eda' => 'How a viewing runs',
	'kca384207' => 'Viewing round',
	'kca9c985e' => 'Small bays,',
	'kcb937fea' => 'Amounts are in USD. The first viewing round is free, and a placement fee is due only once a lease is signed.',
	'kcc3087aa' => 'The portfolio is 6 buildings and 50 bays, from 90 to 420 m², and that is the whole list. We do not handle a bay over 420 m². Foundry Court already reaches that size. We do not handle cold stores. Cool dispatch at Bay 7, Mill Cross Yard, was a cold concrete floor and a 05:00 loading slot, not a refrigerated store. We do not handle hazardous storage. If the goods are hazardous, or the building you need is outside Eastgate, Riverside and Mill Cross, we have no bay to show.',
	'kccee93ce' => 'While you wait, the buildings and the fees are on the site.',
	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kd117dd05' => 'A flower wholesaler wanted north light and a 05:00 loading slot, so we viewed the yard at that hour. Mill Cross Yard has 10 bays, from 150 to 300 m², a clear height of 6.5 m, and rent from $11 per m² per month. The yard is in Mill Cross, between steel-clad sheds, and Tomasz Wrona is the agent.',
	'kd1bfdb49' => 'Quay Lane Units',
	'kd1f4df22' => 'Founder, managing partner',
	'kd389f13e' => 'Bench and light storage',
	'kd4a2d6dd' => 'Every viewing still measures the shutter, walks the loading route and tests the power. A written floor and loading check report is a separate item at $340 if you want the check on paper. The note records that one check. If you need 200 to 420 m² and 8 m of height, name Foundry Court in your request.',
	'kd554d9bf' => 'Your email',
	'kd6511381' => 'Six buildings,',
	'kd6cf9ea9' => 'The six fees',
	'kd75ccc64' => 'Machines and tall loads',
	'kd7daeb65' => 'The bays are Bay 3 at Tanner Row Sheds, Bay 7 at Mill Cross Yard, Bay 2 at Foundry Court and Bay 6 at Ferry Road Depot. Sizes stay at 180 m², 240 m², 320 m² and 160 m². We leave out move-in dates, savings and ratings. Tenants are described by the work they do.',
	'kd80bf456' => '180 m² · Clear height 6 m',
	'kd8d7101b' => 'Placement fee, lease of 25 months or more: 1.5 months\' rent. None of those lines is a fee to put the bay on our list. We take a bay from 90 to 420 m² in the districts we already work. We do not list a cold store, hazardous storage or a bay over 420 m². If the bay is outside that, Henrik Aas will say so in the reply.',
	'kd99a604c' => 'Concept',
	'kdadb38f9' => 'The buildings we can list into are Tanner Row Sheds, Quay Lane Units, Mill Cross Yard, Foundry Court, Ferry Road Depot and Orchard Street Works: 6 buildings, 50 bays, 90 to 420 m². On the visit we measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power. Firms request a viewing with the size, the district and the date they need. We reply within 1 business day.',
	'kdb4fddd6' => 'An owner pays nothing to list a bay. Listing a bay is free for owners. Henrik Aas handles owner relations from Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. Call 555-0142 and ask for him, or write to viewings@hashirapartners.example. We reply within 1 business day. A listing means the bay can be shown in our viewing rounds, inside the 6 buildings, for a size from 90 to 420 m². We do not list cold stores, hazardous storage or anything larger.',
	'kdb5b7ac5' => 'Tanner Row · Bay 3',
	'kdb868a8f' => 'Viewing hours are Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. A round is booked inside the viewing hours. The call that narrows the list to 3 bays is a 20-minute call with Priya Raman. Buildings, bay counts, sizes, clear heights and starting rents are the six sets published for Tanner Row Sheds, Quay Lane Units, Mill Cross Yard, Foundry Court, Ferry Road Depot and Orchard Street Works. Those figures are part of these terms.',
	'kdc3f7839' => 'Is the first viewing round free?',
	'kdc8178df' => '9 bays of 100–220 m², clear height 5 m. Rent from $13 per m² per month.',
	'kdd1d9758' => 'Floor and loading check report',
	'kdda81fef' => 'Office Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30<br>Viewings Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00',
	'kde5cf6fe' => 'On the floor the work is ordinary and exact. We measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power. When the use needs it written up, Daniel Cho prepares the floor and loading check, as he did at Bay 2, Foundry Court, before terms on a hall with 8 m clear. If one bay fits, Lucía Ferrer reads the heads of terms with you. No placement fee is due until a lease is signed.',
	'kde85a9f7' => 'A bicycle-parts seller outgrew a garage and needed one level floor with a roller door wide enough for two vans.',
	'kdf814135' => 'Office',
	'kdfd0b285' => 'Shutter width and clear height',
	'ke04d7395' => 'Eastgate',
	'ke0bb2f66' => 'District',
	'ke0e03090' => 'Seven people,',
	'ke100fb66' => 'A business day is one of those weekdays. Priya Raman coordinates what comes in. A request does not hold a bay. It tells us which of the 6 buildings are worth a call. If the size is over 420 m², or the use is a cold store or hazardous storage, the reply will say that we do not handle it. The useful request is specific about size, district and date.',
	'ke16336e3' => 'Priya Raman',
	'ke190ce81' => 'Tanner Row · 90–180 m²',
	'ke196ecc7' => 'One email a month with the bays that have just come free. No cost, and the first viewing round stays free.',
	'ke27c07ac' => 'He will set it against the published building figures before anyone is invited to a round. Priya Raman still coordinates the firm\'s viewing diary. Tomasz Wrona shows Eastgate and Mill Cross. Adaeze Nwosu shows Riverside and Ferry Road. You are welcome in the bay on the day, which is how an owner answers questions in the room rather than after the fact.',
	'ke3d2fa41' => 'We do not take bays over 420 m², cold stores or hazardous storage. A firm tells us the size, the district and when it needs the bay. We reply within 1 business day. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, is free. The placement fee is paid only once a lease is signed: 1 month\'s rent up to 24 months, or 1.5 months\' rent from 25 months. That is the practice she still runs.',
	'ke58e3ea3' => 'What we do not handle',
	'ke5a849d7' => 'We went at 05:00 because that was the slot they needed to judge. Published viewing hours remain Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. The floor was cold concrete. That is not a cold store, and cold stores are outside what we handle. The note records the light, the hour and the floor. It does not record a result, a rating or a claim that Bay 7 will be empty for the next firm.',
	'ke75d8b4f' => 'It does not reserve a bay. A bay on the list can already be in a viewing round with another firm. The list goes out once a month to the address you give. Other post is answered within 1 business day, in office hours Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30. Viewing hours remain Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00 and are booked separately, after a real request.',
	'ke7608b4f' => 'The new',
	'ke917b9c7' => 'We reply within 1 business day, Mon–Fri 08:30–17:30.',
	'keb3ace9d' => 'Free to view',
	'kebbf8dbc' => 'Cool dispatch',
	'kec35f333' => 'Tell us the size, the district and when you need the bay. We reply within 1 business day.',
	'ked39fb26' => 'What does an owner pay to list a bay?',
	'kee0a64a6' => 'Ferry Road Depot is in Riverside. It has 9 bays, from 100 to 220 m², with a clear height of 5 m. Rent starts at $13 per m² per month. A canopy runs over the loading edge, so the loading walk includes that covered stretch. Adaeze Nwosu is the agent for Riverside and Ferry Road. Bay 6, at 160 m², is the workshop note. A furniture restorer wanted a bench by the shutter and a neighbour who would not mind dust.',
	'kefa437c6' => 'The floor was cold. A cold floor is not a cold store, and we do not handle cold stores. Published viewing hours remain Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. That early visit was arranged because the loading slot was the thing they needed to see. Say if your own work turns on the hour, and we will reply within 1 business day with what we can actually show.',
	'kefa8bd4e' => 'Viewing coordinator',
	'kf04ae2dc' => 'About 2 hours, up to 3 bays, with an agent and, where possible, the owner. The round sits inside viewing hours, Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00. Tomasz Wrona attends bays in Eastgate and Mill Cross. Adaeze Nwosu attends Riverside and Ferry Road. You see each bay with the shutter raised and the floor free to walk. An empty bay is a beginning, and the visit is how you judge it.',
	'kf106530e' => 'That address has no page. The buildings, the fees and the request form are one click away.',
	'kf150b6ce' => 'Quay Lane Units is in Riverside. It has 8 bays, from 120 to 240 m², with a clear height of 5.5 m. Rent starts at $14 per m² per month. The building is a row of brick waterside units with grey shutters. Adaeze Nwosu, agent for Riverside and Ferry Road, shows these units and Ferry Road Depot. On a viewing we measure the shutter, walk the loading route and test the power, and the waterside approach is part of that walk.',
	'kf23cea5b' => 'We use your name and email to reply within 1 business day and to arrange the 20-minute call with Priya Raman, the viewing round, a check, or the read-through with Lucía Ferrer. We use the size and the district to choose among the 6 buildings and 50 bays. We use an owner\'s note so Henrik Aas can talk about a free listing. We use a newsletter address to send the monthly list of newly free bays, and that address is for the list.',
	'kf31a80df' => 'Tanner Row Sheds',
	'kf3dbcb0e' => 'Come to Unit 4, 18 Tanner Row, Port Merrin. Tanner Row is also the street of Tanner Row Sheds, our Eastgate building of 12 bays, from 90 to 180 m². The office and the sheds share the street name. Ask for Unit 4. We do not send a map. When a viewing is booked we name the building, the bay and a time inside Tue–Sat 09:00–15:00, and the visit happens at that building. Eastgate means Tanner Row Sheds and Foundry Court, with Tomasz Wrona.',
	'kf3e59163' => 'Free to list',
	'kf47eb616' => 'Bay 3, Tanner Row Sheds',
	'kf4c6f851' => 'Notes',
	'kf8c71867' => 'Join with a single email address, the one you actually read. Use the field on this page, or write to viewings@hashirapartners.example and ask for the new bay list. There is no fee for the list. The first viewing round, up to 3 bays, remains free. Listing a bay remains free for owners. The list does not replace the 20-minute call with Priya Raman. When a bay on it looks right, tell us the size, the district and when you need it.',
	'kf9029505' => 'The first viewing round is free. A placement fee of 1 month\'s rent is due only once a lease is signed. On a lease of 25 months or more the placement fee is 1.5 months\' rent.',
	'kf907357f' => 'Bay guide',
	'kf9cc1b0c' => 'Bring your list',
	'kfa2ea83a' => 'No preference',
	'kfa46005e' => 'Thank you,',
	'kfa69325d' => 'Adaeze Nwosu is the agent for Riverside and Ferry Road. The depot has a canopy over the loading edge, and Bay 6 opens onto a yard used with neighbouring bays. Dust, the bench and the neighbour were the brief, so those were the things to stand next to with the shutter open.',
	'kfab676e7' => 'When a firm needs to see the loading hour itself, we have viewed at that hour, as we did at 05:00 for Bay 7 at Mill Cross Yard. The published hours do not move. The owner, when they can attend, answers for that building in the room. Come ready to look at three bays, not at a full tour of all 50. The first round is free. Each extra viewing round is $120.',
	'kfaee9e09' => 'Henrik Aas, owner relations, speaks to owners about listing a bay, which is free.',
